"equipment":{"weapon":"WP22003","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1023805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1010","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[51,72,59,21,27,60],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP22003","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1023805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1010","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[51,72,59,21,27,60],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP22003","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1023805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1010","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[51,72,59,21,27,60],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP22003","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1023805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1014","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[51,72,59,21,27,60],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP22003","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1023805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10327","city":"CS1010","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[51,72,59,21,27,60],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP22003","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1023805"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"初为黄巾军，跟随曹操后守卫汜水关，擅使流星锤。在曹营的关羽得知刘备消息，而携刘备夫人们告别曹操。离去的路上途经汜水关时，卞喜假意款待关羽一行人，实则暗中安排刀斧手欲害关羽。但因关羽路过寺庙，被僧人所提醒而有所防备，反将杀手全部杀尽，卞喜亦被斩之。","tc":"初為黃巾軍，跟隨曹操后守衛汜水關，擅使流星錘。在曹營的關羽得知劉備消息，而攜劉備夫人們告別曹操。離去的路上途經汜水關時，卞喜假意款待關羽一行人，實則暗中安排刀斧手欲害關羽。但因關羽路過寺廟，被僧人所提醒而有所防備，反將殺手全部殺盡，卞喜亦被斬之。","en":"Originally a Yellow Turban soldier who later served Cao Cao guarding Sishui Pass, skilled with a meteor hammer. While staying in Cao Cao's camp, Guan Yu learned news of Liu Bei, bade farewell to Cao Cao, and departed with Liu Bei's wives. Along the way, upon reaching Sishui Pass, Bian Xi feigned hospitality toward Guan Yu and his party while secretly arranging axemen to kill Guan Yu. However, when passing a temple, Guan Yu was alerted by a monk, being forewarned, he slew all the assassins, and Bian Xi himself was also cut down.","jp":"初めは黄巾軍に属し、曹操に従った後は汜水関を守衛した。流星鎚の使い手である。曹操陣営にいた関羽が劉備の消息を知り、劉備の夫人らを連れて曹操に別れを告げた。その帰途で汜水関を通過した際、卞喜は関羽一行を歓待するふりをしつつ、密かに刀斧手を配して関羽を害そうと企てた。しかし、関羽は道中で立ち寄った寺院の僧侶から警告を受けて警戒していたため、逆に刺客たちをことごとく討ち果たし、卞喜もまた斬って捨てられた。","kr":"본래 황건적 출신으로, 조조를 섬긴 뒤 사수관을 지켰으며 유성추를 능숙하게 다루었다. 조조의 진영에 머물던 관우가 유비의 소식을 듣고, 유비의 부인들을 데리고 조조에게 작별을 고했다. 떠나는 길에 사수관을 지나게 되자 변희는 겉으로는 관우 일행을 극진히 대접하는 척하면서 은밀히 도부수를 매복시켜 관우를 해치려 했다. 그러나 관우가 사찰을 지나던 중 승려의 귀띔을 받아 미리 대비책을 세워 두었기에, 매복한 자객들을 역으로 모조리 베어 넘겼고 변희 역시 목이 베이고 말았다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10328","remark":"","surname":"卞","surnameTc":"卞","surnameEn":"Bian","surnameJp":"卞","surnameKr":"변","surnameOther":"","name":"喜","nameTc":"喜","nameEn":"Xi","nameJp":"喜","nameKr":"희","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"卞喜","power":"WJ10327","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1014","gender":"0","rule":"51","force":"72","wise":"59","politics":"21","charm":"27","will":"60","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"5","politicsTalent":"1","charmTalent":"1","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"28/72/28/28/28/19/50/28